WarraqCraft is an original clean-room LaTeX authoring environment. It contains
no code, documentation text, artwork or other proprietary material from
TeXstudio, Overleaf, TeX Live or any other TeX distribution or editor.

Optional bundled engine: Tectonic (https://tectonic-typesetting.github.io),
MIT License — fetched by `scripts/fetch-tectonic.ps1` into `bin/` and
invoked as a subprocess, never linked or copied into WarraqCraft's source.

Bundled document templates are original WarraqCraft starter sources. The
template importer is for user-selected sources and copies text formats
only; it records the caller-provided license/provenance in template
metadata and does not change the license of the imported materials.

Third-party libraries:

- craft-atomic, craft-quit, craft-settings, craft-print
  (https://github.com/storytold/craft-libs) — MIT OR Apache-2.0.
- craft-ai (https://github.com/NibrasAz7/craft-libs, feat/craft-ai) —
  MIT OR Apache-2.0.
- spellbook (https://github.com/helix-editor/spellbook) — MPL-2.0.
  Hunspell dictionaries (en_US) are fetched by `scripts/fetch-dict.ps1`
  into `dicts/` at user request and are not part of this distribution.
